Subject: [PATCH 5/8] =?UTF-8?q?fix(web):=20newcomer=20tab=20title=20no=20l?=
 =?UTF-8?q?onger=20reads=20'Rasikh=20=C2=B7=20Rasikh';=20add=20app=20icon?=
